acceptance_criteria: "An explicitly supplied token budget raises the derived row limit above the default page cap, because the explicit budget is the more specific instruction; budget_derived_limit is emitted on every budgeted response, never omitted, and carries the reason it took its value including clamped-by-page-cap; When the budget is not the binding constraint the envelope names the constraint that is; A regression test asserts that raising the budget across the page-cap boundary changes the row count, with a negative control at a budget below the floor"
