expected_result: Higher explicit budgets return more rows above default caps and every budgeted receipt explains its derived limit.
actual_result: "List, search, and context bypass default caps for explicit budgets and emit budget_derived_limit, binding_constraint, and limit_reason with cursor-safe compaction."
